# TILTSHOT: the code. CODE on the title opens an eight-letter entry (UP and
# DOWN change a letter, LEFT and RIGHT move, A enters). A wrong code does
# nothing; BEAM-DOWN (printed in the credits) brings two old friends onto
# the tour for good: WICK and KIP join the five golfers, cosmetic like them.
seed 12
game tiltshot
wait 30
expect cameos == 0
expect golfers == 5
press DOWN
press DOWN
press A
wait 5
expect state == 1
# AAAA-AAAA does nothing
press A
expect code_ok == 0
expect cameos == 0
press A
expect state == 1
press UP
press RIGHT
